<title>INDIA: Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - Dec 10.</title>
<headline>Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - Dec 10.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is an analysis of the 30-share Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE) index movement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The table shows the stocks which moved the index most during the day (upto 0630 GMT) and their percentage contribution to the net change.</p>
<p>The index at 0630 GMT was 2787.32, 27.74 points or 0.99 percent lower than Monday's close.</p>
